0..73 Comment "// A cell introduced with a value on the face it is fixed on violates its"
74..148 Comment "// boundary: the boundary law and β at that point rewrite one term to two"
149..225 Comment "// normal forms, a variable and `zero`, no rule the path order orients joins"
226..299 Comment "// them, and the block\'s rules are refused by name. The extension type of"
300..378 Comment "// `../../model/extension/zero-fiber.gandr` introduces a cell by its value off"
379..397 Comment "// the face alone."
398..400 Comment "//"
401..431 Comment "// - see: #641 — `FreeFiber`"
433..508 Comment "/// `ins` takes the cell\'s value at both points, so `outp(ins(x, y))` reads"
509..550 Comment "/// `zero` by the boundary and `x` by β."
